WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.920
My name is Liu Maoxing.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.010
People call me Mao.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.940
In the traditional cuisine competition against Shaoan,

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.130
I reproduced my mother's

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:43.660
Mystery Mopo Tofu that I remember.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.650
And because of it, I became the head chef of
Chrysanthemum Tower

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.160
which is the best restaurant of Sichuan.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:48.980
Great!

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.010
Besides, I'm finally recognized to be

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.240
the official successor to my chef mother.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:54.590
But...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:56.450
Mao.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:57.760
Yes.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.000
Before I appoint you as

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.610
new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.850
I have a condition.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.800
You need to study in the gourmet capital Guangzhou.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.880
and get the qualification for Super Chef.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.040
Super Chef?

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.720
Go For It! Super Chef

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.820
It is said that Super Chef is the peak of

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.170
Chinese Cooking Society.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:33.680
A competition is held in every four years.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.560
Confident chefs all over the country

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.510
will gather in a place and compete with each other.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:40.160
If the competition

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.260
is held in Guangzhou which is the gourmet capital,

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:43.650
its difficulty will be higher.

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:46.840
There are a lot of people who gave up

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.610
their cooking careers after failing

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.980
for many times.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.850
People who overcome difficulties

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.870
and get the honor \"Super Chef\"

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.460
have a higher chance to enter the Imperial Buttery.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.170
Before you learn in Guangzhou

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.280
and get the qualification for Super Chef,

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.120
you cannot go back to Sichuan.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.940
That is Guangzhou?

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.210
What a big city!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.930
It's true that we should eat in Guangzhou.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.960
There are various fresh ingredients everywhere.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.040
In Guanzhou,

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.640
there is a chef who can

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.050
maximize the tastiness of bok choy.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.470
He's the head chef of Yang Spring Restaurant

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.950
which is the best restaurant of Guangzhou.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.370
He's Chef Ruoh.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:57.240
Chef Ruoh?

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:00.570
But where is Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.580
Who can help me catch it?

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:07.720
It's a Swinhoe's pheasant.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:08.950
You!

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.740
Please help me catch it!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:11.540
OK. OK.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.640
I'm on it! Stop running!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.810
See? I've caught you.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.770
Yes, that's it.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:24.860
It hurts!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.200
Stop running!

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.440
You're really useless.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.350
You're a man,

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:33.570
but you can't help me at all,

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.290
honestly!

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:35.410
Be like a man a little bit.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.140
Stop running!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.400
It hurts!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:46.360
It hurts so bad!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.710
Shoot.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.000
I'm confused about the roads of Guangzhou.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.970
Where on earth is Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.580
Crap.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.670
Why does a kid like you

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.420
want to find Yang Spring Restaurant which is

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.010
the best restaurant of Guangzhou?

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.310
My name is Mao.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.510
I'm the head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower of Sichuan.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.440
What did you say?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.380
You bragged to me without thinking about it.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:11.660
The Chrysanthemum Tower you said

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.450
is the restaurant of Chef Pai who's

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.370
the \"Fairy of Sichuan Cuisine\", right?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:16.980
You've heard of it?

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.890
Chef Pai is my mother.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.810
A kid like you is a head chef.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:23.820
Looks like Sichuan cuisine

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.580
only contains kid's food.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.350
What?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:27.850
Follow me, kid.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.250
I'll show you dishes of Guangzhou.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:36.000
(Yang Spring Restaurant)

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.810
This is Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.070
There are so many guests.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.260
Of course.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:43.690
All chefs here are top chefs

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.640
of Guangdong, just like me.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.780
Yang Spring Restaurant is the best restaurant of Guangdong.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.400
No, it's the best restaurant of the whole country.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:52.950
You also work here?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:53.890
Well...

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.540
The kitchen is there. Follow me.

00:05:58.970 --> 00:05:59.520
We've arrived.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.720
Char siu is still not ready?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:04.990
Bring three big plates here.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:05.940
Hurry up!

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:08.670
There is no enough oil.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:09.300
Bring oil here now.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:10.830
Stop staring blankly. Hurry up!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:12.270
I'll go get it right away.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.180
This is not a joke.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.030
Who is Head Chef Ruoh?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.750
Head chef seldom comes here.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:26.550
The person who usually manages this restaurant

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.190
is Chef Zhou Yu who stands in the innermost place.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:39.980
Amazing.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:41.200
Plate.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:42.680
He's so amazing.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:43.980
Great.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.450
I'm Mao. I come from Sichuan.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.860
I hope I can study here from today.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.040
Please agree to it.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:53.530
Oyster sauce.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.160
Please...

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.640
I'm willing to do anything for you.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:58.420
You idiot.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.340
How can a bumpkin

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.580
like you join the kitchen

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.330
of the best restaurant of Guangzhou?

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.760
Go back now.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.160
Wait a minute.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:06.970
I've also got

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.900
a letter of introduction written by
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.600
What? Provincial Military Commander Li?

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.900
A letter of introduction?

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.090
He mentioned Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.320
Who is this kid?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.650
Everyone is very shocked.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.960
We're going to have lunch soon.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.170
Kid, make a dish for us.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:45.140
Make Stir-fried Bok Choy for us.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.500
OK. OK.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.440
The aroma and the texture of bok choy are both good.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.470
It's a representative vegetable of Chinese cuisine.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.630
I think it should be the same in

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.330
Guangdong or Sichuan.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.750
Boil water in a pot

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.850
and heat another pot until there is smoke.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.790
Cook bok choy in boiling water first.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.200
If I don't do like that,
it'll be hard to fry the bok choy.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.870
Get ready to stir-fry bok choy after boiling it.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.510
I'm gonna impress everyone with the strong flavor

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.750
of Sichuan cuisine.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.370
Mix and stir-fry it rapidly. Done.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:25.540
Wait and see.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.680
As long as you take a bite,

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.700
you'll be impressed by the impact of Sichuan cuisine.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.600
Would you like to have a taste?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.150
Please have a taste, guys.

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:51.920
Hey.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:52.360
Yes.

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.250
Who fried the mung bean sprouts today?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:56.820
Wang Fu fried it.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.210
His cooking skills are better than before.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:58.810
It's him?

00:08:58.920 --> 00:08:59.950
He can sell it.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.590
Sanjie, please have a taste.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.620
Is something like that edible?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.660
You... What's wrong with you?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.600
You haven't even pick up the food.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.200
When will you stop eating?

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.060
It's time to prepare things for the afternoon.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.410
OK.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.050
Hurry up. Go.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.750
Only my dish hasn't been eaten by anyone. Why?

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.990
Is Sichuan's taste too strong for

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:38.880
Cantonese?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:41.550
No way. I cooked it the way my mother

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.770
taught me.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:43.880
In Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.810
even the solider who was born in Guangzhou

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.330
can accept the flavor of my mother's dishes.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.380
Bok choy is the most commonly used

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.650
and the most basic vegetable.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.280
I can't even make delicious bok choy, can I?

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.570
Gosh. Why?

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:01.660
Why on earth can't I make it?

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.260
What on earth is wrong

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.390
with my bok choy?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.630
Crap.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.400
They can even eat the tasteless

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.370
Chinese steamed bun,

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:16.730
but they refused to eat my dish.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.020
Chef Zhou Yu,

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.640
please put it in the Chinese steamed bun and have a taste.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.600
You still don't get it.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.670
It's so hot.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.170
If your nose is broken and unavailable,

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:31.420
you can stuff it

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.050
like that.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:38.120
My nose is broken and unavailable?

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.130
Nose.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.030
Right. It's the smell.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:51.120
Although there is only a little.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:52.240
If there is a little earthy smell,

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.940
it'll be easy for people outside to smell it.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.820
The kitchen is filled with so many kinds of smells.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.490
I didn't expect that people could still smell

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.350
such a little earthy smell.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.470
Cooking is not only about seasoning.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.490
Besides, people who eat a dish

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:11.160
feel its smell first.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.720
If the dish made by you is not aromatic,

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:15.830
no one will pick up the food of your dish.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:16.700
Aroma?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.880
But in Sichuan,

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.220
there is no such earthy smell.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.340
Of course.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.170
There is one difference

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.110
between Guangzhou and your hometown Sichuan.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.440
If you don't even know it,

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.880
I'm afraid that you can't survive
in the gourmet capital

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.200
Guangzhou.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:36.380
What did you say?

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.000
I think you should go back to Sichuan.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.510
People like you can be the head chef.

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.230
Sichuan cuisine is rather easy.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.350
I think dishes of the Fairy of Sichuan

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.290
are much worse than those of Guangzhou.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.620
Don't speak ill of my mother.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.880
Go back now since you've already known it.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.940
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.380
Sichuan is different from Guangzhou.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.590
What on earth does it mean?

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:38.640
It's raining.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.110
Go now!

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:46.590
Go away! Get out of my way!

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:47.680
Go away!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.820
Hey! Please help me pick up the liquor bottle.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.410
It dropped into the river by accident.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:14.970
liquor?

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.390
Look. It's there.

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.060
Could you please help me pick it up?

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.020
Go pick it up!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:23.900
OK.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.570
Hurry up! Stop dawdling.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.210
Wonderful.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.840
Sorry. I'm sorry.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.540
Take it, sir.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:41.890
Thank you so much.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:43.740
There is still much liquor in it.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:54.620
The liquor has spilled out.

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:56.020
Well, it's okay.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.320
I'd like to send my liquor to the river today.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.050
But...

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.260
Look.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.980
How beautiful and glistening the trace of liquor is!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:07.640
It's true.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.410
The trace of liquor is so beautiful.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:12.610
That is the reason

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.250
why the Jing River became muddy
because of the Wei River.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.420
The earthy smell is so stinky.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.250
Earthy smell.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.180
There is one difference

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.540
between Guangzhou and your hometown Sichuan.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.500
Right.

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.660
I got it. I finally got it.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.080
Sir?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.660
The kid yesterday

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.000
has given up and gone back, right?

00:14:58.220 --> 00:14:58.880
I think so.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:14:59.860
A lot of people like him

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.070
come here every year.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.350
But it's not that easy.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:13.760
What's up, kid?

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.880
Are you here to beg for leftovers?

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:18.370
Please...

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.990
Could you please let me stir-fry bok choy again?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:21.620
Please...

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.800
No matter how many times you stir-fry it,
the result will be the same.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:24.820
Just one day passed.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.270
Will there be a difference?

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:27.960
Right. Get out!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:33.570
Can you do it?

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:34.860
Yes, I can.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.380
What?

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.490
It's still the same as yesterday.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.160
It's the same as yesterday until now.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.360
But after that, it's different.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.300
This is my trump card.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.310
I'm counting on you, magical water.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:15.110
Please remove the earthy smell.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.810
Great.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.600
Next, blanch bok choy quickly.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.240
Stir-fry. Stir-fry. Stir-fry.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.380
I'm done, Chef Zhou Yu.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.770
It looks like the same as yesterday.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.570
Your nose is available today.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.220
I think it.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.130
He ate it.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.150
It's great!

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.900
The plate is the answer.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:20.130
Yes. Yes.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.050
Wonderful, kid.

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.210
Yesterday's earthy smell is gone.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.650
The reputation is not fake.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.600
You're indeed the son of Chef Pai

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.090
who is the \"Fairy of Sichuan\".

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.150
It tastes so fresh and delicious.

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:33.190
Great!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.930
It only took you one day to figure it out.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:38.120
Yes.

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:39.910
The difference between Sichuan and Guangzhou

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.390
is in water.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:42.750
There is

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.700
fine loess in Guangzhou's water.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:48.240
So when I blanch bok choy,

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.990
the earthy smell will permeate the whole dish.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:52.930
Therefore,

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.700
I've tried many ways.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.750
But I failed to

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.990
remove the earthy smell in water completely.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:17:59.630
Then I changed my mind.

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:01.060
I thought

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.000
maybe I could blanch bok choy

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.160
without water.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.560
The thing you poured into the water is the secret.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:08.820
What's that?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:09.930
It's the oil.

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.230
I know it's the oil,

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.360
but it can't be the ordinary oil.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:14.980
Right.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.120
That's the oil used before cooking Sichuan cuisine.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.450
It mixes chicken fat extracted from the chicken

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:20.320
and peanut oil

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:23.420
in a certain proportion.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.370
So it's a kind of very light

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.690
and fresh oil.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.850
(Diagrams of the dish)

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:31.680
First, pour oil into water.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.630
Form an oil slick on the surface of water.

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.990
When I put bok choy into the pot,

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.180
it'll be covered with the oil immediately

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.320
and a film will form.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.840
In this way,

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.540
I can blanch the bok choy

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:44.870
without any water.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.200
And yesterday's earthy smell

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:50.300
will not permeate into the dish.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.660
This kind of fresh mixed oil

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:55.910
can also bring out

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.260
the aroma and taste of bok choy.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:18:59.570
I've tried many ways.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.320
It turns out that it's the best way.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.250
You came up with it within one night?

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:05.180
Yes.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:07.690
Now I finally understand

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.560
why Provincial Military Commander Li wrote
a letter of introduction for you.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.060
Please...

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:12.810
I'll work hard.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.200
Could you please let me stay here?

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:16.730
Your name is Mao?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:17.350
Yes.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.210
Practice of Yang Spring Restaurant is very strict.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:21.140
You should mentally prepare yourself.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.260
OK. OK.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:33.740
Zhou Yu!

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:34.230
Yes.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.580
I've drunk all the liquor.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.060
It's the drunken man I met yesterday.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:43.440
Kid,

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.940
he's Chef Ruoh, the head chef here.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.470
He's Chef Ruoh mentioned by

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.360
Provincial Military Commander Li?

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.190
Are you the kid I met yesterday?

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:58.460
Why are you here?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.160
He wants to be an apprentice here.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.950
OK.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:03.800
Zhou Yu,

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:04.830
has he taken the test

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.000
on loess.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:07.920
Yes.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.060
It only took him one day to solve the problem.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.120
Thanks for your hint.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.590
Did I say anything?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.750
But you did pass the test

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.160
on loess within one day.

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:25.080
It's hard.

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.340
Sometimes, loess dyes

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.540
the whole land yellow.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.000
Sometimes, the East China Sea

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:33.970
becomes yellow because of loess.

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.050
Therefore,

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.830
cuisine of this country

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.840
is a battle with water.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:45.420
However, it is said that the sage likes water.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.550
As long as you can realize

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.110
the mystique of Guangzhou's muddy water,

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:49.810
you're already successful.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.050
Zhou Yu.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:51.420
Yes.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:52.500
Mao.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:53.270
Yes.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:54.450
Now I appoint you as

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.710
fourth-class chef who's responsible for bok choy.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:57.590
OK.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.200
From now on, you'll receive training with me.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:01.000
You need to get prepared for it.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:01.930
OK.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.620
After knowing how to cook bok choy,

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.470
try to learn knife skills

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.630
and fire skills with all kinds of vegetables.

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:14.540
Somebody helps!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:16.840
Help me catch it.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:18.360
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:19.190
Stop running!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:21.920
Meili, what are you doing?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.070
Don't let the chicken run here.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.350
Sorry, dad.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.030
You're the girl at that time...

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:32.650
You.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:33.980
Let me introduce her to you.

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:35.170
This is my daughter, Meili.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.560
I'm Mao. Nice to meet you.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.140
Then

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:42.830
I started to learn in Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.290
Stop running!

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.480
Stop running!

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:18.493
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.493 --> 00:23:21.733
Sanjie will be excommunicated because I joined?

00:23:21.733 --> 00:23:24.903
No matter how much of a tradition it is
in the Yang Spring Restaurant, it can't be like that.

00:23:24.903 --> 00:23:28.197
I have to do something about it,
there has to be a way.

00:23:28.281 --> 00:23:30.075
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.158 --> 00:23:32.201
Ruthless! The Rules of Yang Spring Restaurant!!

00:23:32.327 --> 00:23:33.953
It will definitely be interesting!
